d 'POLYTEST': module to provide tests of the latent-normality assumption behind tetrachoric, polychoric and polyserial correlations
d
d      The pairwise goodness-of-fit tests reported by polycorr
d cannot test normality for a 2x2 table. Such a table has three
d free cell    probabilities and three parameters (two thresholds
d and the tetrachoric correlation), so it fits exactly. polytest
d adds two tests    that cover this case and polyserial pairs. 
d
d KW: polyserial test
d KW: triplet test
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261030
d
d Author:  Yusuf Toyin Yusuf,  Kwara State University
d Support: email  YUSUF.YUSUF@@KWASU.EDU.NG
d
f polytest.ado
f polytest.sthlp
f polytest_example.do
f polytest_cert.do
